    {
      "seg_id": 16,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Esmolol, a beta blocker, is used to stabilise the cardiovascular response during the perioperative period.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 17,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Esmolol effectively blocks undesirable cardiovascular responses during endotracheal intubation and extubation and is also used for treating tachyarrhythmias such as supraventricular tachycardia.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 18,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Additionally, evidence indicates that esmolol affects antinociception and obtunds the BIS response.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 19,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "These findings have led to many studies about the sparing effects of beta-blockers on inhalation anaesthetics and opioids during the perioperative period.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 20,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Johanson et al.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 21,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "reported that esmolol reduced the minimum alveolar concentration of isoflurane.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 22,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "White et al.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 23,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "and Collard et al.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 24,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "showed that perioperative esmolol administration reduced the required amount of fentanyl, which is used as a rescue analgesic in the recovery room.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 25,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "These findings suggest that administration of a beta-blocker may reduce the amount of opioid necessary for maintaining adequate anaesthetic depth.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 26,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Also, it is expected that beta-blockers would have a positive effect on the speed and quality of post-anaesthetic recovery.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 27,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "However, there have been only a few studies on the relationship between beta-blockers and the requirement for opioids during surgery, and these did not present clinically applicable information.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 28,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "We performed this study to identify the effects of an intraoperative continuous infusion of low-dose esmolol on the required effect-site concentration of remifentanil and on post-anaesthetic recovery.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 29,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "esmolol: a 0.5 mg/kg loading dose of followed by an infusion of 30 µg/kg/min during surgery",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 30,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_군명",
